{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-22",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "同一本书的注解  (Different Commentaries on One Classic)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Bu Xiaogu lugs a heavy parcel into Chun Yuqiao's office and discovers dozens of different editions of the same ancient Chinese classic inside. Listen to Xiaogu and Yuqiao discuss the books in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，你这快递里装的是什么呀，这么重？我帮你拆开。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "等会儿，你手没事吧？来，把手伸出来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我的手没事，你想太多了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "纸质的书容易弄脏，先洗一下手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，怎么都是道德经同一本书啊？这是您的特殊爱好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "老子在两千多年前写下道德经，之后的人都在做不同的注解。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "每一个时期、每一个版本，还有每一个出版社，他们的注解都不一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "要看就好好看，这一句光是注解就有三页。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "看出什么来了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "看出来了，他们想多了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这三个字读一下，反过来读也能读得通。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，你这快递里装的是什么呀，这么重？我帮你拆开。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, what is packed inside your parcel that makes it so heavy? Let me open it for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "等会儿，你手没事吧？来，把手伸出来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hold on, is your hand alright? Come here, hold out your hands.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我的手没事，你想太多了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My hands are fine; you are overthinking it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "纸质的书容易弄脏，先洗一下手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Paper books get dirty easily, so go wash your hands first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，怎么都是道德经同一本书啊？这是您的特殊爱好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, why are they all copies of the same classic? Is this a special hobby of yours?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "老子在两千多年前写下道德经，之后的人都在做不同的注解。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Laozi wrote this classic over two thousand years ago, and scholars ever since have written different commentaries.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "每一个时期、每一个版本，还有每一个出版社，他们的注解都不一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Across every era, every edition, and every publisher, the commentaries all differ.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "要看就好好看，这一句光是注解就有三页。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you are going to read it, read carefully; the commentary on this single line runs three pages.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "看出什么来了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you spotted anything in it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "看出来了，他们想多了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I spotted it — those commentators overthought everything!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这三个字读一下，反过来读也能读得通。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Read these three characters aloud; even read backwards, they still make sense.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，你这快递里装的是什么呀，这么重？我帮你拆开。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "等会儿，你手没事吧？来，把手伸出来。",
      "gap": 0.5
